# CLI/app (`packages/jess`)

## What lives here

- CLI entrypoint: `packages/jess/bin/cli.js`
- Core app logic: `packages/jess/src/**`
- Large Less-oriented test suite under `packages/jess/test/less/**`

## Fixture-driven testing

- The Less test harness documentation is in `packages/jess/test/less/README.md`.
- If you changed `packages/core`, build it first so `packages/jess` tests see updated `@jesscss/core` output.

